---
<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><meta http-equiv="refresh" content={'0;url='+destination}/><link rel="canonical" href={new URL(destination,Astro.site)}/><meta name="robots" content="noindex"/><title>笔记搬到新地址了 · onlylo</title></head><body><p>这篇内容已经搬到新地址。<a href={destination}>继续阅读 →</a></p></body></html>
